WEBVTT

00:01:37.243 --> 00:01:41.289
Ah, I am so bored.

00:01:41.289 --> 00:01:43.875
If you have so much time,
why don't you help us clean?

00:01:43.875 --> 00:01:45.752
No way!

00:01:45.752 --> 00:01:48.838
I just don't feel like it.

00:01:48.838 --> 00:01:50.590
You lazy bum.

00:01:53.343 --> 00:01:56.220
Ayeka, I'm starving.

00:01:56.220 --> 00:02:00.475
Well, it is about time for
Sasami to be finished cooking.

00:02:00.475 --> 00:02:03.561
She'll come and get us
when it's ready, Mihoshi.

00:02:03.561 --> 00:02:06.230
Girls, thanks for cleaning.

00:02:06.230 --> 00:02:08.566
Aah! Don't mention it.

00:02:08.566 --> 00:02:11.944
Since we're staying at your place,
it seems only fair, you know?

00:02:11.944 --> 00:02:13.446
Well, then, in that case,

00:02:13.446 --> 00:02:17.492
I might as well ask you to wipe
the floors while you're at it, huh?

00:02:17.492 --> 00:02:18.993
What?

00:02:19.660 --> 00:02:21.704
Ah, yes, my pleasure.

00:02:22.914 --> 00:02:23.998
You idiot.

00:02:23.998 --> 00:02:25.875
Did you say something, Ryoko?

00:02:25.875 --> 00:02:27.251
No, nothing.

00:02:27.251 --> 00:02:30.129
Here, Ayeka.

00:02:30.129 --> 00:02:33.132
Let's have some of
these to boost our energy.

00:02:33.132 --> 00:02:35.009
Those? Ah, where'd you...

00:02:35.551 --> 00:02:38.346
They were right over there, you see?

00:02:38.346 --> 00:02:40.723
You took them from there?

00:02:40.723 --> 00:02:44.143
Yup. And there were a whole bunch more, too.

00:02:46.562 --> 00:02:49.774
Ah, this one's really hard.

00:02:49.774 --> 00:02:50.983
Ayeka?

00:02:50.983 --> 00:02:53.569
Huh?

00:02:53.569 --> 00:02:55.363
Lunch is ready!

00:02:55.363 --> 00:02:56.989
Wow, lunch!

00:02:56.989 --> 00:02:59.492
Well, time certainly does fly.

00:02:59.492 --> 00:03:02.537
Come quickly before it gets cold.

00:03:02.537 --> 00:03:04.038
Thanks for taking the trouble.

00:03:04.038 --> 00:03:06.916
And I am so hungry.

00:03:12.213 --> 00:03:15.216
Ryo-Ohki, where have you been?

00:03:20.221 --> 00:03:23.224
Excuse me, Grandpa.
What is that thing over there?

00:03:23.224 --> 00:03:25.518
Ah, that thing?

00:03:27.019 --> 00:03:30.481
Well, Sasami, there is a goblin in there.

00:03:35.903 --> 00:03:38.281
It all happened 700 years ago.

00:03:38.281 --> 00:03:43.161
It is said a horrible goblin came from the sky.

00:03:43.161 --> 00:03:48.749
So people built a shrine with a
magical force field to seal in the goblin

00:03:48.749 --> 00:03:52.879
because they were afraid of trouble.

00:03:52.879 --> 00:03:56.924
And that, Sasami,
is the origin of the Masaki shrine.

00:03:56.924 --> 00:03:58.968
Hey, a real goblin. Wow.

00:03:58.968 --> 00:04:00.845
It sounds scary.

00:04:00.845 --> 00:04:04.140
Oh, my, does the goblin exist, really?

00:04:04.140 --> 00:04:07.185
Maybe it does, maybe it doesn't.

00:04:07.185 --> 00:04:10.146
But you stay away from that place.

00:04:13.983 --> 00:04:16.736
The 700-year-old goblin.

00:04:17.778 --> 00:04:20.072
This could be a fun way to kill some time.

00:04:20.072 --> 00:04:22.533
Come on, Princess Fraidy-cat,
let's go and check it out.

00:04:22.533 --> 00:04:25.912
- Come on, let's go.
- Whoa! No, thank you!

00:04:25.912 --> 00:04:30.541
Weren't you listening to
what Grandfather was telling us?

00:04:30.541 --> 00:04:35.421
And I don't want the goblin to come to
life and, like, put a curse on us, you know?

00:04:35.421 --> 00:04:38.508
And me, I would like to see the goblin.

00:04:39.717 --> 00:04:44.222
I'm with you. Let's forget
about Ayeka. Come on. Ow!

00:04:44.222 --> 00:04:48.976
Sasami, don't. If you go, I'll be so worried.

00:04:48.976 --> 00:04:52.814
Besides, it's lunchtime now. Let's go home.

00:04:52.814 --> 00:04:54.315
All right.

00:04:56.734 --> 00:04:59.862
OK. I thought it would be fun.

00:04:59.862 --> 00:05:02.323
But I don't want to go alone.

00:05:29.141 --> 00:05:31.769
This walk took a lot longer than I thought.

00:05:34.689 --> 00:05:36.607
I am starved.

00:05:36.607 --> 00:05:39.277
I'd better get something to eat pretty soon.

00:05:39.277 --> 00:05:40.736
Tenchi.

00:05:45.116 --> 00:05:47.201
It's you, Ryoko.

00:05:47.201 --> 00:05:49.203
Welcome home, Tenchi.

00:05:49.203 --> 00:05:52.957
You know, you didn't have to
come out to meet me, Ryoko.

00:05:57.295 --> 00:06:00.506
R-Ryoko, what's the deal with that rope?

00:06:02.383 --> 00:06:04.969
L-I wonder what it could be for!

00:06:06.929 --> 00:06:09.098
Stop it!

00:06:19.859 --> 00:06:23.571
Wow, it sure goes a
long way back there, huh?

00:06:23.571 --> 00:06:26.824
Hey, can we go home? Come on.

00:06:26.824 --> 00:06:28.826
No.

00:06:28.826 --> 00:06:32.747
Ryoko, you know Grandpa has been
telling me to stay away from this cave.

00:06:32.747 --> 00:06:35.207
Then there's that goblin story.

00:06:35.207 --> 00:06:38.085
You scared? Is that it, Tenchi?

00:06:38.085 --> 00:06:40.546
No, that is not it.

00:06:40.546 --> 00:06:43.215
Well, OK, then. Let's explore together.

00:06:43.215 --> 00:06:44.884
You're so weird.

00:06:44.884 --> 00:06:46.260
I don't like ordinary dates.

00:06:46.260 --> 00:06:47.803
This is better, isn't it?

00:06:47.803 --> 00:06:50.056
I don't know.

00:06:50.056 --> 00:06:51.974
You know it is. Don't be difficult.

00:06:51.974 --> 00:06:55.186
Ah, don't push me like that.

00:06:55.186 --> 00:06:59.148
Just let me go home!

00:07:18.042 --> 00:07:19.961
Tenchi's late.

00:07:22.254 --> 00:07:25.508
What could have
happened to Tenchi, I wonder?

00:07:25.508 --> 00:07:28.427
I made a nice dinner tonight.

00:07:31.097 --> 00:07:32.598
Ryo-Ohki.

00:07:34.767 --> 00:07:36.477
Ryo-Ohki, what?

00:07:36.477 --> 00:07:38.813
That's Tenchi's bag, isn't it?

00:07:38.813 --> 00:07:41.357
Ah? What?

00:07:41.357 --> 00:07:43.776
Indeed this is Tenchi's bag.

00:07:43.776 --> 00:07:46.696
Oh, where did you find this, Ryo-Ohki?

00:07:51.701 --> 00:07:52.118
"Snap"

00:07:53.035 --> 00:07:55.287
Where? Where?

00:07:55.287 --> 00:07:59.208
You tell me where he is!

00:07:59.208 --> 00:08:02.336
Say something darn it!

00:08:02.336 --> 00:08:06.257
I think, if Ryoko were here, we'd be
able to understand what she is saying.

00:08:06.257 --> 00:08:08.843
Right, if Ryoko were here...

00:08:12.555 --> 00:08:17.309
Oh, I am so absentminded. How could
I have forgotten about that woman?

00:08:17.309 --> 00:08:20.646
I should have known.
How could I be so stupid?

00:08:20.646 --> 00:08:23.274
Oh, yes, Ryoko must be with Tenchi

00:08:23.274 --> 00:08:28.154
doing this and doing that. How dare she?!

00:08:28.154 --> 00:08:29.321
Ryo-Ohki!

00:08:29.321 --> 00:08:33.993
I beg you, you sweet little
thing you, please take us to Ryoko.

00:08:35.369 --> 00:08:37.288
For five carrots?

00:08:39.123 --> 00:08:42.460
Oh, thank you. You'll take us there.

00:08:42.460 --> 00:08:45.087
Here, this is Tenchi's scent.

00:08:51.844 --> 00:08:54.096
Now, let's get going!

00:08:54.096 --> 00:08:56.182
- Yeah!
- Yeah!

00:08:59.685 --> 00:09:00.519
Ah, it's a dead end.

00:09:00.519 --> 00:09:03.189
Let's give up and go home, Ryoko.

00:09:11.864 --> 00:09:14.158
Oh, man! Look what you've done now.

00:09:14.158 --> 00:09:16.619
What are you gonna do if we get cursed?

00:09:16.619 --> 00:09:19.830
I'll think about that if it happens.

00:09:22.166 --> 00:09:24.043
What was that?

00:09:33.719 --> 00:09:36.889
Ryoko! Hey, Ryoko! Oh, no! No.

00:09:36.889 --> 00:09:39.725
Ryoko, you were such a good person.

00:09:39.725 --> 00:09:41.185
Well, not really, but...

00:09:41.185 --> 00:09:43.062
Ouch.

00:09:43.062 --> 00:09:44.522
Ryoko, you're alive!

00:09:44.522 --> 00:09:46.440
What's this?

00:09:48.818 --> 00:09:50.945
Now, what the heck? I...

00:09:51.070 --> 00:09:54.281
"Go home, idiot!"

00:09:55.241 --> 00:09:58.244
To hell with magical force fields and goblins.

00:09:58.244 --> 00:10:00.371
Let's get out of here, Tenchi!

00:10:04.458 --> 00:10:05.960
Huh?

00:10:07.753 --> 00:10:09.046
"Stupid"

00:10:10.631 --> 00:10:15.678
Somebody's mocking me.

00:10:17.137 --> 00:10:19.265
Come out and face me!

00:10:31.777 --> 00:10:33.362
Ah, this place is...

00:10:33.362 --> 00:10:37.783
Oh, no! Ayeka, this must
be where the goblin is!

00:10:39.243 --> 00:10:40.953
We're going in.

00:10:40.953 --> 00:10:43.998
But what if the goblin
has been resurrected?

00:10:43.998 --> 00:10:49.086
I'm not about to leave Ryoko
alone with Tenchi, not in this place.

00:10:49.086 --> 00:10:50.296
Absolutely no way!

00:10:50.296 --> 00:10:54.425
I cannot let that happen!
I am not going to allow it!

00:10:54.425 --> 00:10:58.178
She doesn't really seem to
care about the goblin, does she?

00:10:58.178 --> 00:10:59.179
Mm-mmm.

00:11:22.150 --> 00:11:25.090
This is where the goblin is imprisoned.

00:11:25.090 --> 00:11:29.280
Yeah, right. No goblin, no nothing. Just rock.

00:11:31.830 --> 00:11:35.520
This looks like a meteorite.

00:11:37.270 --> 00:11:38.790
Huh?

00:11:40.030 --> 00:11:43.600
Huh? Huh? Huh? Huh?

00:11:47.840 --> 00:11:49.940
Wh-What's that?

00:11:50.550 --> 00:11:53.040
Could this be the goblin?

00:11:54.550 --> 00:11:56.920
It couldn't be.

00:11:56.920 --> 00:12:01.010
Hey, Ryoko, shouldn't
we get going now? Ryoko.

00:12:03.860 --> 00:12:05.550
Come back.

00:12:06.430 --> 00:12:09.200
This place is nice and private.

00:12:09.200 --> 00:12:12.400
Nobody will bother us here.

00:12:12.400 --> 00:12:14.070
And what do you mean by that?

00:12:14.070 --> 00:12:16.540
Look at me, Tenchi.

00:12:16.540 --> 00:12:19.640
I think I'm gonna pass on that.

00:12:19.640 --> 00:12:22.280
Come on, now, look at me.

00:12:22.280 --> 00:12:23.410
I don't think so!

00:12:23.410 --> 00:12:25.680
Tenchi, look!

00:12:25.680 --> 00:12:28.580
I thought we came to explore the cave!

00:12:28.580 --> 00:12:30.880
Mmm, and we did.

00:12:31.990 --> 00:12:34.010
Tenchi!

00:12:36.360 --> 00:12:37.930
Tenchi! Huh?

00:12:37.930 --> 00:12:38.830
What?

00:12:38.830 --> 00:12:40.320
Ayeka.

00:12:42.260 --> 00:12:45.260
- Oh, boy! What now?
- Ah, oh.

00:12:47.270 --> 00:12:50.100
Look who's here. What's up now, Princess?

00:12:50.100 --> 00:12:53.170
What were you doing in here?

00:12:53.170 --> 00:12:55.110
Trying to seduce Tenchi.

00:12:55.110 --> 00:12:57.650
I knew something like this was going on.

00:12:57.650 --> 00:13:00.550
You... You are such a...

00:13:00.550 --> 00:13:01.950
You are envious, aren't you?

00:13:01.950 --> 00:13:03.320
What do you mean?!

00:13:03.320 --> 00:13:05.620
Ayeka, calm down.

00:13:05.620 --> 00:13:09.460
No! I cannot allow her to
continue like this, Tenchi.

00:13:09.460 --> 00:13:11.330
This woman needs to be disciplined.

00:13:11.330 --> 00:13:12.860
Otherwise, she will
become even more arrogant!

00:13:12.860 --> 00:13:17.130
Yeah? Just how are you
gonna discipline me exactly?

00:13:21.440 --> 00:13:26.530
As a princess, I am gifted with
beauty, intelligence, and lots of power!

00:13:34.120 --> 00:13:36.350
Oops, was it a bit too strong for you?

00:13:36.350 --> 00:13:38.340
I am so sorry.

00:13:39.650 --> 00:13:44.390
That's enough, Princess.
You are so obnoxious!

00:13:45.460 --> 00:13:47.620
An eye for an eye!

00:13:52.570 --> 00:13:54.440
That was not too friendly.

00:13:54.440 --> 00:13:56.370
I was just getting even.

00:13:56.370 --> 00:13:58.510
Doesn't seem like there's a goblin here.

00:13:58.510 --> 00:14:00.340
It sure doesn't.

00:14:09.050 --> 00:14:11.780
Get ready, Ayeka.

00:14:16.960 --> 00:14:18.550
Ahh, no way.

00:14:20.090 --> 00:14:24.290
Hmm, that's heavy.

00:14:27.070 --> 00:14:29.400
Too bad, Ryoko.

00:14:29.400 --> 00:14:31.870
Now the game is over.

00:14:32.710 --> 00:14:37.440
I can do it! Don't take me lightly, Ayeka!

00:14:45.650 --> 00:14:47.140
Take this!

00:14:57.000 --> 00:14:59.260
An earthquake?

00:15:08.110 --> 00:15:10.630
Do you like that, Princess?

00:15:16.820 --> 00:15:19.420
Oh, no, Tenchi! Could this be...

00:15:19.420 --> 00:15:22.050
Could it be the goblin?

00:15:27.330 --> 00:15:29.300
Oh, damn, it's... It's crumbling.

00:15:29.300 --> 00:15:31.130
You caused all this, you know.

00:15:31.130 --> 00:15:34.190
Hey, we'd better get out of here right now.

00:15:37.610 --> 00:15:39.010
Ayeka!

00:15:39.010 --> 00:15:41.240
Ayeka, come quickly!

00:15:41.240 --> 00:15:44.210
Oh, Tenchi...

00:15:44.210 --> 00:15:47.150
Ummm. Tenchi, I'm scared.

00:15:47.150 --> 00:15:50.750
Ayeka, don't tell me that I didn't warn you.

00:15:50.750 --> 00:15:54.410
You leave Tenchi alone, Ryoko! Aah!

00:15:56.820 --> 00:15:58.290
Ayeka, this way.

00:15:58.290 --> 00:16:00.190
You can stay there if you want to.

00:16:00.190 --> 00:16:02.090
Tenchi!

00:16:17.580 --> 00:16:20.080
Wow, there really is a goblin.

00:16:20.080 --> 00:16:22.550
This is not the time to be impressed, Sasami!

00:16:22.550 --> 00:16:28.960
Hmmph! Well, I'm not afraid of
any goblin, so eat this, goblin head!

00:16:33.830 --> 00:16:36.060
Uh-oh. It doesn't work?

00:16:36.060 --> 00:16:38.330
Hmm.

00:16:38.330 --> 00:16:40.770
Tenchi, let's go.

00:16:40.770 --> 00:16:42.930
Oh, Ryoko.

00:16:43.340 --> 00:16:46.800
- It's coming toward us!
- Everybody run!

00:16:53.710 --> 00:16:56.380
It's still coming after us!

00:16:56.380 --> 00:16:59.550
Hurry! Run for your lives!

00:17:14.440 --> 00:17:15.870
Aah, Tenchi!

00:17:15.870 --> 00:17:17.360
Tenchi!

00:17:19.810 --> 00:17:22.710
- Tenchi!
- Tenchi!

00:17:28.020 --> 00:17:30.820
Hmm.

00:17:30.820 --> 00:17:35.260
All right, you've had enough
fun for one night, I think.

00:17:35.260 --> 00:17:36.750
Grandpa?

00:17:41.460 --> 00:17:46.500
I didn't think you would
figure out who I was so easily.

00:17:46.500 --> 00:17:48.930
Who the heck are you?

00:17:51.040 --> 00:17:56.530
My name is Washu, the greatest
scientific genius in the universe.

00:17:57.580 --> 00:17:59.940
You are Washu. You're the greatest.

00:18:00.880 --> 00:18:03.120
You are Washu. You're the genius.

00:18:03.120 --> 00:18:06.250
Washu, Washu, you're
the one! Hooray for Washu!

00:18:08.120 --> 00:18:12.030
Washu? Washu! Ah, I remember now.

00:18:12.030 --> 00:18:15.330
You're the most famous
mad scientist in the universe!

00:18:15.330 --> 00:18:20.670
Aha, the scientist that
was exiled 700 years ago.

00:18:20.670 --> 00:18:24.000
So you fell onto this planet, huh?

00:18:24.000 --> 00:18:27.640
Somehow, the people in
those days knew instinctively

00:18:27.640 --> 00:18:29.440
that the meteorite contained something evil.

00:18:29.440 --> 00:18:34.450
That was why they built the Masaki Shrine.

00:18:34.450 --> 00:18:37.920
Hmm, so you are the
goblin they were talking about.

00:18:37.920 --> 00:18:39.120
What are you talking about?

00:18:39.120 --> 00:18:43.020
There's no goblin as cute as me, but anyway,

00:18:43.020 --> 00:18:45.190
which one of you broke
the seal and released me?

00:18:45.190 --> 00:18:48.530
You swung me around so
hard, I thought I would die.

00:18:51.330 --> 00:18:53.370
Hey! What'd I do?!

00:18:53.370 --> 00:18:57.470
Hmm, you be a water sprite,
so you can reflect on your conduct.

00:18:57.470 --> 00:18:58.960
Huh?

00:19:03.640 --> 00:19:06.480
Ribbit, ribbit, ribbit.

00:19:06.480 --> 00:19:08.820
- Wow! She's so cute!
- Wow! She's so cute!

00:19:08.820 --> 00:19:13.050
I just rearranged her genes and
accelerated the metabolism of her cells.

00:19:13.050 --> 00:19:15.720
Way too easy for a genius like me.

00:19:15.720 --> 00:19:17.990
I am such a genius!

00:19:17.990 --> 00:19:22.830
Wow, I'm impressed, but wasn't
it kind of silly to do that, huh?

00:19:24.130 --> 00:19:26.700
You called me silly?

00:19:26.700 --> 00:19:28.970
Ribbit, ribbit, ribbit.

00:19:28.970 --> 00:19:30.770
Ribbit, ribbit!

00:19:30.770 --> 00:19:33.170
- So adorable.
- So adorable.

00:19:34.140 --> 00:19:36.240
That'll teach you to call me silly, yeah.

00:19:36.240 --> 00:19:37.410
Incredible.

00:19:37.410 --> 00:19:38.280
What?

00:19:38.280 --> 00:19:43.350
You're right. You're very powerful.
Please forgive them.

00:19:43.350 --> 00:19:46.720
Hmm, you're interesting.

00:19:46.720 --> 00:19:49.890
Very interesting. What's your name?

00:19:49.890 --> 00:19:51.760
Tenchi... Tenchi Masaki.

00:19:51.760 --> 00:19:56.860
Tenchi, huh? And you
must call me Little Washu, OK?

00:19:56.860 --> 00:19:59.200
Uh... all right.

00:19:59.200 --> 00:20:02.240
Looks like we have another
pretty lady in our household.

00:20:02.240 --> 00:20:04.500
You should be happy, Tenchi.

00:20:06.270 --> 00:20:07.810
Ribbit.

00:20:07.810 --> 00:20:09.870
Ribbit, ribbit, ribbit.

00:20:12.880 --> 00:20:15.820
Look what happened to this storage closet.

00:20:15.820 --> 00:20:19.080
She seems to be quite settled in now.

00:20:24.260 --> 00:20:28.430
I must be a little rusty after
700 years of imprisonment.

00:20:28.430 --> 00:20:32.990
I'd better work on an invention
or something to get myself going.

00:20:42.480 --> 00:20:45.110
So then that legend about the goblin...

00:20:45.110 --> 00:20:47.820
Seems it was a true story after all.

00:20:47.820 --> 00:20:52.650
Tenchi, I'm telling you,
she's even worse than a goblin.

00:22:55.110 --> 00:22:56.880
Another Galaxy Police
detective, Kiyone, joins us.

00:22:56.880 --> 00:22:58.780
She used to be Mihoshi's partner.

00:22:58.780 --> 00:23:01.080
Now she's under orders to
search for Mihoshi on earth,

00:23:01.080 --> 00:23:02.850
but somehow, she doesn't wanna be here.

00:23:02.850 --> 00:23:05.050
Oh, Kiyone, long time no see!

00:23:05.050 --> 00:23:08.360
You see, we have the best
partnership in Galaxy Police.

00:23:08.360 --> 00:23:11.460
I knew you would come for me, Kiyone.

00:23:11.460 --> 00:23:13.830
There's nothing like a good
partnership, don't you agree?

00:23:13.830 --> 00:23:15.800
